In src/index.css, update .editor-body .todo-content so empty to-do items maintain full line height (min-height: 1.6em; display: block;) instead of collapsing to 0px:

CSS
.editor-body .todo-content {
  display: block;
  flex: 1 1 0%;
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 1.6em;
  outline: none;
